H7eELpFhnAX4ySuVgJbm","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_prepare_route","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":22,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've priced a 7-step route and need your approval before anything runs. The policy cap is $15.00.\n\nYour Robinhood Chain (`rh1`) and Arbitrum (`arb1`) wallets have no ETH, so they can't pay for their own swaps. The route first sends a small amount of ETH to each wallet for transaction fees.\n\n| # | Quote | Leg | In | Expected out | Cost |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | q_1 | Swap ETH to WBTC on `eth1` | 0.1 ETH | 495000 WBTC units (0.00495 BTC) | $3.90 |\n| 2 | q_2 | Send ETH to `rh1` for fees | 0.001 ETH | 0.000833 ETH | $1.40 |\n| 3 | q_4 | Send WBTC to `rh1` | 247500 | 246666 | $1.40 |\n| 4 | q_7 | Swap WBTC to ETH on `rh1` | 246666 | 0.0492332 ETH | $0.36 |\n| 5 | q_3 | Send ETH to `arb1` for fees | 0.001 ETH | 0.000833 ETH | $1.40 |\n| 6 | q_5 | Send WBTC to `arb1` | 247500 | 246666 | $1.40 |\n| 7 | q_8 | Swap WBTC to USDC on `arb1` | 246666 | 147.6996 USDC | $0.36 |\n\n**Total cost: $10.2208.** The approval caps it at the same amount.\n\n**Why the Arbitrum half swaps on Arbitrum:** I also priced swapping WBTC to USDC on Ethereum and then sending the USDC to Arbitrum. That costs about $6.70 instead of $3.16 and delivers 145.00 USDC instead of 147.70.\n\n**Expected ending balances:**\n- **`eth1`:** about 0.048 ETH, from 0.15 ETH minus the 0.1 ETH swap, the 0.002 ETH sent for fees and Ethereum transaction fees. It keeps more than enough ETH for another transaction.\n- **`rh1`:** about 0.04907 ETH, after paying for its own swap.\n- **`arb1`:** about 147.70 USDC and about 0.00081 ETH, enough for another transaction.\n\nEach step will run only after the previous one confirms and I've checked the receiving balance. If the first swap returns a slightly different amount of WBTC, I'll split the actual amount in half.\n\nApprove this plan (approval `appr_10`), reject it, or set a lower cost cap?"}]},{"role":"user","sequence":23,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_10"},"id":"toolu_01V3kwwSKExxsdAe1X4uTry8"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_11\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01V3kwwSKExxsdAe1X4uTry8","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_11"},"id":"toolu_01XbLeq9Nrgc4zQ8XApSUr2k"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01XbLeq9Nrgc4zQ8XApSUr2k","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_017JNgQTTS2jmE7kGxJnBHye"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_017JNgQTTS2jmE7kGxJnBHye","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_2","approval_id":"appr_10"},"id":"toolu_011rbzNkpZ2WPpDN5bsBV98V"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":31,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_12\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_011rbzNkpZ2WPpDN5bsBV98V","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":32,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_12"},"id":"toolu_014shLFWH7SwinsSGgBR86yF"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":33,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"pending\"}","toolC